{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Verification of fix commit (Change-Id I89f8b654399acb562742e575227645f4696fd66c), 2026-11-04 PST:\n- New test test_import_git_process_count_does_not_depend_on_acting_session: fails without the fix (125 git processes with a session id vs 100 without, 6 rows), passes with it.\n- Benchmark test_benchmark_commit_count_is_ceil_per_pass, run alone: before 310.0 s wall, timeout, load 28-36; after 79.6 s wall, pass, load 19-21.\n- n=50 import with a session id: 120 git processes / 15.8 s before, 19 / 2.5 s after (same as the no-session run).\n- Import, cross-session and reconciler suites: 3966 passed. make lint and make typecheck pass; import_tickets complexity unchanged at its baseline of 45; import_ndjson.py is 368 lines.\n- make verify, default tier: 20762 passed, 2 failed in 2 h 2 min at load 24-28. Both failures are CLI facade tests that also fail on origin/main without this change when run after another CLI test in one process: filed bald-diagnostic-cricket.\n- Integration tier run separately: 202 passed, 1 failed in 8 min 29 s at load 25-40. The benchmark no longer times out. The failure is the live-Jira test_delete_permission_probe index-visibility flake: filed bottom-hawkish-sunfish."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1793805058483148001,"uuid":"08ec9158-0578-4d6d-b1ce-72f2ab09e317"}